	(text "FT232RNL USB-UART (bus-powered, 3.3V I/O)\\nSymbol: Interface_USB:FT232RL (RNL is pin/spec identical, different fab)\\nVCC = VBUS; VCCIO = 3V3OUT; TEST tied to GND\\nInternal oscillator: OSCI/OSCO NC; RESET NC (internal pull-up)\\nFT232RL is EOL - order FT232RNL-REEL"
